{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/valentinyeo/multiprompt-android/pulls/294","id":5200069904,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTqgTS88AAAABNfLFEA","html_url":"https://github.com/valentinyeo/multiprompt-android/pull/294","diff_url":"https://github.com/valentinyeo/multiprompt-android/pull/294.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/valentinyeo/multiprompt-android/pull/294.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/valentinyeo/multiprompt-android/issues/294","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/valentinyeo/multiprompt-android/pulls/294/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/valentinyeo/multiprompt-android/pulls/294/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/valentinyeo/multiprompt-android/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/valentinyeo/multiprompt-android/issues/294/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/valentinyeo/multiprompt-android/statuses/e2732a00cda1de908b27e0b2883ccbfa788fc98d","number":294,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"HYCI-169: Multiprompt Android runs phone checks for unrelated changes","user":{"login":"software-factory-runners[bot]","id":348741585,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOFMlf0Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3296316?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/software-factory-runners%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/software-factory-runners","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/software-factory-runners%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/software-factory-runners%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/software-factory-runners%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/software-factory-runners%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/software-factory-runners%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/software-factory-runners%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/software-factory-runners%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/software-factory-runners%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/software-factory-runners%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary for non-engineers\n\n- Skip phone work for documentation-only and release-note-only changes.\n- Keep all six required phone check results present and successful when that work is unnecessary.\n- Keep phone proofs running for app, build, workflow, proof-tool and unknown changes; nightly and manual coverage remains unchanged.\n\nTicket: https://app.hypertask.ai/detail/project-11514/169\n\n## Change\n\n`Android tests` gets a fail-closed changed-file router using the actual PR merge-base diff. Six existing phone jobs retain their check names and run a routing guard; only their expensive steps are conditional. Required check policy remains unchanged; no skipped required jobs or path-filtered required workflows.\n\nFive optional phone workflows additionally cover root Gradle configuration, wrappers and the shared phone action. Existing cancellation groups remain intact. This is deliberately conservative: all changes other than docs/root Markdown/release-notes still run every required phone proof.\n\n## Verification\n\nNo builds or tests run on the VPS. GitHub runs routing regression proof before dispatching expensive phone work. The tests drive the real router against temporary Git histories: documentation-only, mixed app/docs, deletion, rename, advanced base, missing and invalid revisions. They also check the six required contexts and optional workflows' build/action inputs, schedule, dispatch and cancellation.\n\n`git diff --check` is clean. Actual Actions results are pending; no green or shipment claim.\n\n## Real timing evidence — baseline only\n\nhttps://github.com/valentinyeo/multiprompt-android/actions/runs/42288577129\n\nSix successful phone jobs on this app-change PR took **2,465 job-seconds combined**, **735 seconds wall time** (n=1, job start/end timestamps, queue excluded). Individual durations: reply notifications 228s, session rows 449s, image preview 315s, approved style 357s, session pins 734s, message actions 382s.\n\n**After: pending real runs.** This is not a docs-only baseline and is not a measured speedup. A bounded lookup found no genuine docs-only/release-note-only run in recent history. Preserve the requirement for comparable real before/after timings and a full-day slowdown-alarm observation before closing the ticket.\n\n## Risk and rollback\n\nExclusions are intentionally narrow; unknown inputs and empty diffs run phone checks. Router failure fails required phone contexts instead of bypassing them. Revert this PR to restore unconditional phone work. No release/signing settings, required-check contracts, billing or paid services changed.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-07T08:58:09Z","updated_at":"2026-11-07T08:58:09Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"c98178021ba3e82d6dd13be90be2a96dcd47b621","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"valentinyeo:ci-runner-5/hyci-169","ref":"ci-runner-5/hyci-169","repo":{"id":1319637835,"node_id":"R_kgDOTqgTSw","name":"multiprompt-android","full_name":"valentinyeo/multiprompt-android","owner":{"login":"valentinyeo","id":3296316,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyOTYzMTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3296316?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/valentinyeo","html_url":"https://github.com/valentinyeo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valentinyeo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valentinyeo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valentinyeo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valentinyeo/starre